# Eucalyptus regnans F.Muell. (Mountain Ash)
# Taxon concept, anatomical subsystems (PO:*), pipe-model & biophysical allometry,
# obligate-seeder fire ecology, InstanceState64 ontogenetic parameter bounds,
# ecological relations (RO:*), and South-Eastern Australian Biocultural Country
# provenance (SPC / Local Contexts).
#
# Evidence boundary (per tree-cases.md):
# Taxonomic, morphological, and biophysical traits below represent sourced working
# reference bounds for the species across its wet-sclerophyll range in Victoria and
# Tasmania (working focus: Victorian Central Highlands / Yarra Ranges). Exact site
# and individual occurrence identification remain pending field resolution.

