                         "Taungurung Country (North-Central Highlands & Goulburn Catchment, VIC)" ,
                         "Boonwurrung Country (Dandenong Ranges & Western Port Foothills, VIC)" ,
                         "GunaiKurnai Country (Strzelecki Ranges, Baw Baw & Gippsland, VIC)" ,
                         "Gadubanud / Eastern Maar Country (Otway Ranges, VIC)" ,
                         "Palawa / Lutruwita Country (Huon, Derwent & North-East Valleys, TAS)" ;
    tk:noticeType "TK_Notice_Open_To_Collaborate" , "BC_Notice_Biocultural_Provenance" ;
    tk:noticeRef <https://localcontexts.org/labels/traditional-knowledge-labels/> ;
    q42:commonsGovernance "Social Permissive Commons (SPC)" ;
    rdfs:comment "Country attribution spans Wurundjeri, Taungurung, Boonwurrung, GunaiKurnai, and Gadubanud / Eastern Maar Country across Victoria, alongside Palawa / Lutruwita Country in Tasmania. Local Contexts TK/BC notices record biocultural provenance without asserting community-authored TK labels absent direct First Nations co-design."@en .
